          },
          {
            "Text": "An array of link objects. Each link object includes: A \u0022rel\u0022 field whose value can be prev or next.An \u0022href\u0022 field whose value is the link (relative to the base API URL) for the previous or next page of learning entities matching the requested criteria. If the previous or next page does not exist, the corresponding link object will be omitted",
            "Links": [],
