              "A \u0022rel\u0022 field whose value can be prev or next.",
              "An \u0022href\u0022 field whose value is the link (relative to the base API URL) for the previous or next page of learning entities matching the requested criteria."
            ]
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Learning Pagination Reference Table",
      "Anchor": "learning-pagination-reference-table",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Learning Pagination Reference Table"
      ],
      "Text": "Each localeAndType Finder endpoint and its parameters are documented below. Note that all parameter names and values are case-sensitive.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "learningAssets localeAndType Finder",
      "Anchor": "learningassets-localeandtype-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "learningAssets localeAndType Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "To retrieve a page of learning assets, given some criteria, issue a GET call to the following endpoint:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "learningAssets localeAndType Finder",
      "Anchor": "learningassets-localeandtype-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "learningAssets localeAndType Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "Tip",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "learningAssets localeAndType Finder",
      "Anchor": "learningassets-localeandtype-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "learningAssets localeAndType Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "The content library is licensed by language. One LinkedIn Learning tenant may have access to English assets while another may have access to French and German assets. The \u0022localeAndType\u0022 finder does not filter results based on licensing. If your use case requires bulk importing LinkedIn Learning assets licensed to a tenant, use the \u0022criteria\u0022 finder. Review Retrieve learning assets based on requester\u0027s licensed access for additional information.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "learningAssets localeAndType Finder",
      "Anchor": "learningassets-localeandtype-finder",
      "SectionPath": [
        "learningAssets localeAndType Finder"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/learningAssets?q=localeAndType",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Parameters",
      "Anchor": "parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
