          {
            "Text": "The locale country of the learning assets. The value of this parameter should be DE, US, ES, FR, ID, IT, JP, KR, NL, PL, BR, TR or CN. These values correspond to the locales \u0022de_DE\u0022, \u0022en_US\u0022, \u0022es_ES\u0022, \u0022fr_FR\u0022, \u0022in_ID\u0022, \u0022it_IT\u0022, \u0022ja_JP\u0022, \u0022ko_KR\u0022, \u0022pl_PL\u0022, \u0022pt_BR\u0022, \u0022tr_TR\u0022 and \u0022zh_CN\u0022.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "expandDepth",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The number of levels in the learning asset hierarchy to include asset details. This parameter is optional; please see the Specifying the level of asset details section for an explanation with examples.",
